sequenceDiagram
    participant DSO as Grid Operator
    participant CSMS as Central System (CSMS)
    participant Charger as Charging Station (EVSE)
    participant EV as Electric Vehicle (EV)

    Note over DSO, CSMS: Grid demand returns to normal
    activate CSMS
    
    DSO->>CSMS: Grid Signal (e.g., via OSCP)<br>Ends request for grid support
    activate Charger

    CSMS->>Charger: OCPP: SetChargingProfile.req<br>(Sends new profile to stop discharge)

    Charger-->>CSMS: OCPP: SetChargingProfile.conf

    Charger->>EV: ISO 15118: Stop Discharge
    activate EV
    EV-->>Charger: ISO 15118: Confirm Stop
    deactivate EV

    Note over Charger, EV: Bidirectional energy transfer ends

    Charger->>CSMS: OCPP: TransactionEvent.req<br>(eventType: Updated, chargingState: "EVConnected")
    CSMS-->>Charger: OCPP: TransactionEvent.conf

    deactivate Charger
    deactivate CSMS